    <title>X$^3$-Attention: Fast $O(n \log n)$ Kernels for $n \geq 10^6$</title>
    <summary>  We study kernels with complexity $O(n \log n)$ and error
   bounded by $\epsilon \geq 0$.

  Our second contribution is a bound of the form $x_i^2 \leq
    \sum_j w_j$ over all inputs.</summary>
